 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Denying an action",
   "texto": [
    "To deny the continuous present, **-m-** is inserted before **-(I)yor**: **çalışıyorum** (work / study) → **çalışmıyorum** (no work / no study).",
    "**Bugün** means «Today». **Her gün** means «daily».",
    "In yes / no questions, the **mi/mı/mu/mü** particle is written separately and is given the personal termination: **Çalışıyor musun?** = are you working?"
   ]
  },
